{title: The great I Am}
{subtitle: Hymnal 5}
{x_theme: grace-mercy, heaven, holy-spirit, healing, name-of-jesus}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/The great I Am.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
He’s the great I Am, everlasting Father.
He’s the prince of peace, the great eternal wonder.
Holy counselor, Zion’s righteous governor.
He’s the great, He’s the great I Am.

{comment: Verse 1}
God is Elohim of all the holy prophets,
The Elshaddai of all the seers and sages,
He’s the mighty one of all the sacred pages,
He’s the great, He’s the great I Am.

{comment: Verse 2}
He’s Jehova God, the coming King of glory,
He’s the true Nissi, the Lord of grace and favor,
He is Jesus Christ, Redeemer, Friend and Savior,
He’s the great, He’s the great I Am.

{comment: Verse 3}
He’s the strong Rophi, the healing One of Heaven,
He’s the Holy Ghost, the Spirit poured from glory,
He’s the sacred One of all the gospel story,
He’s the great, He’s the great I Am.
